    242          /******************************************************************
    243          *
    244          * SUB-ROUTINE  po_unlock
    245          *
    246          *------------------------------------------------------------------
    247          *
    248          * purpose : releases a spin lock and restores the original IRQL at
    249          *      which the caller was running.
    250          *
    251          ******************************************************************/

